sequenceDiagram
  participant Visitor as Visitor
  participant Frontend as React SPA
  participant API as WP REST /phase2/auth
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant Admin as Admin User
  Note over Visitor,Frontend: Registration Request
  Visitor->>Frontend: Fill Registration Form
  Frontend->>API: POST /register {name, email, pwd, region, unit}
  API->>DB: INSERT pending record
  API-->>Frontend: 202 Accepted
  API-->>Admin: Email "New Registration"
  Admin->>WP Admin UI: Review pending list
  Admin->>DB: UPDATE status=approved, role, customer_code
  DB-->>API: Row updated
  API-->>Visitor: Email "Account Approved"
  Visitor->>Frontend: Login
  Frontend->>API: POST /login
  API-->>Frontend: JWT Token 